---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /practice/game/
title: "Catch the Word — Typing Game"
description: "Mini-game built on your missed-words list. Words fall from the top; type them before they hit the bottom. Adapts to your weakest patterns."
hideBreadcrumbs: true
hidePageHeader: true
pageSlug: practice-game
---

<div class="game-page" data-game-root>
  <header class="game-header">
    <div class="game-header__brand">
      <h1 id="game-title">Catch the Word</h1>
      <p class="muted" id="game-subtitle">Type the falling words before they hit the bottom. Weighted toward letters and words you've struggled with.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="game-header__stats" id="game-stats">
      <div class="game-stat"><span class="game-stat__label">Score</span><span class="game-stat__value" data-score>0</span></div>
      <div class="game-stat"><span class="game-stat__label">Caught</span><span class="game-stat__value" data-caught>0</span></div>
      <div class="game-stat"><span class="game-stat__label">Missed</span><span class="game-stat__value" data-missed>0</span></div>
      <div class="game-stat"><span class="game-stat__label">Streak</span><span class="game-stat__value" data-streak>0</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class="game-mode-switch" aria-label="Game mode">
    <button type="button" class="game-mode-switch__btn is-active" data-game-mode="classic" data-tip="Catch the Word -- words fall, you type them. Three misses ends the round.">Classic</button>
    <button type="button" class="game-mode-switch__btn" data-game-mode="endless" data-tip="No three-miss cap. Spawns forever, faster each catch. Personal high score saved.">Endless</button>
    <button type="button" class="game-mode-switch__btn" data-game-mode="shooter" data-tip="Words drift across the screen. Type the next one to shoot it before it leaves the frame.">Shooter</button>
  </nav>

  <section class="game-stage">
    <svg id="game-svg" class="game-svg" viewBox="0 0 800 500" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-label="Falling words"></svg>
    <div class="game-input-wrap">
      <input
        id="game-input"
        class="game-input"
        type="text"
        autocomplete="off"
        autocorrect="off"
        autocapitalize="off"
        spellcheck="false"
        inputmode="text"
        enterkeyhint="done"
        aria-label="Type the falling words"
        placeholder="Type a falling word…"
      >
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="game-speed" aria-label="Fall speed control">
    <label class="game-speed__label" for="game-speed">Speed</label>
    <input id="game-speed" class="game-speed__range" type="range" min="0.5" max="2.5" step="0.1" value="1.0" aria-label="Fall speed multiplier" data-tip="Drag to control how fast words fall.">
    <span class="game-speed__val" data-speed-val>1.0×</span>
  </section>

  <section class="game-actions">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" id="game-start">Start</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn" id="game-pause" hidden>Pause</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn" id="game-reset" hidden>Reset</button>
    <a href="/practice/" class="btn btn--ghost">Back</a>
  </section>

  <section class="game-howto" aria-label="How to play">
    <h2>How to play</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Words fall from the top. Type the next one before it hits the bottom.</li>
      <li>Catch one to earn points. A streak multiplier kicks in after 5 in a row.</li>
      <li>Three misses ends the round.</li>
      <li>Words come from your <strong>missed-words list</strong> when available — if you've never missed a word, it falls back to high-error keys from your typing history.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>

<script type="module" src="/assets/js/pages/game-boot.js?v={{ cssVersion }}"></script>
